
  Manage simulated infrastructure resources                                     
         
  USAGE  
         
    cli-app [command] [--flags]  
            
  COMMANDS  
            
    completion [command]  Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
    help [command]        Help about any command
    resource [command]    Manage resources
         
  FLAGS  
         
    --color               Result color mode (auto, always, never) (auto)
    --config              Configuration file path
    -h --help             Help for cli-app
    --log-level           Logging level (debug, info, warn, error) (warn)
    --output              Result format (text, json) (text)
    --quiet               Suppress non-essential output
    --timeout             Override the timeout for the selected resource operation (0s)
    -v --version          Version for cli-app

